<title>AUSTRALIA: Paladin to raise A$93.4 mln for purchases.</title>
<headline>Paladin to raise A$93.4 mln for purchases.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paladin Australia Ltd, manager of the Paladin Industrial Trust, said on Monday the trust would raise A$93.4 million in equity to help fund the A$141.3 million purchase of a portfolio of 22 industrial properties.</p>
<p>Paladin said the capital raising would be through the placement of 32.81 million units to institutional investors, a one-for-one rights issue of 65.61 million units to unitholders and a public offer of 6.56 units to Australian investors.</p>
<p>It said the issue price of placement, rights issue and public offer was 89 cents per unit.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
